# weld:sqlcx:installed __version__
# sqlc.yaml names the sqlc-dynamic plugin, so plain sqlc can no longer generate
# on its own: sqlc-dynamic runs the sqlc pinned beside it in tools/sqlcx with
# itself on PATH, then writes internal/data/sqlc/dynamic/sqlcx_gen.go.
SQLC_GENERATE = cd tools/sqlcx && go tool sqlc-dynamic generate -f ../../sqlc.yaml
